## Findings by Area

### ComposeAppProcess Class

{"type":"gap","id":"gap-SH-CAPS-AUTODEPLOY","category":"SPEC_NOT_IMPLEMENTED","priority":"P1","area":"ComposeAppProcess","spec_ref":"SH-DEPLOY-FLOW","spec_file":"13-service-hub-v2.smd","spec_says":"Step 4: 'docker run' — the hub starts the container as part of the deployment flow. Step 6: health monitoring on a 5-second cycle.","impl_has":"ServiceHub.start() detects if a container is already running and logs it. For containers NOT running it logs 'Container not running — deploy via API to start' and does nothing. ComposeApps are never auto-started on hub boot unless they are already running. Only the POST /deploy endpoint triggers start().","impl_file":"hub.py:972-990","recommendation":"On hub startup, for apps whose container is not running AND whose docker config has restart=always, call app.deploy() in a background thread (or at minimum app.start() if image already exists). This brings hub behavior in line with spec step 4 and matches the principle in SH-DP-3 that the hub provisions.","status":"open","delta":"NEW"}

{"type":"gap","id":"gap-SH-YAML-PARSER-RISK","category":"UNDERSPECIFIED_NOW_IMPLEMENTED","priority":"P2","area":"ComposeAppProcess","spec_ref":"SH-DEPLOY-CONFIG","spec_file":"13-service-hub-v2.smd","spec_says":"Hub reads .compose.yaml. Spec does not prescribe how to parse YAML — stdlib-only is a valid implementation choice.","impl_has":"Custom recursive-descent YAML parser (_parse_yaml, _parse_block, _parse_list). Handles scalars, nested mappings, sequences, quoted strings, comments. Does NOT support anchors, aliases, multi-line scalars, flow syntax.","impl_file":"hub.py:62-242","recommendation":"Document the parser's limitations prominently. The .compose.yaml spec (08-composeio-app-framework.smd) should explicitly restrict to the supported subset. Risk: a real .compose.yaml with a multi-line string in environment values (e.g., a certificate PEM) will silently lose data. Add a parser test against the canonical board-manager .compose.yaml from the spec.","status":"open","delta":"NEW"}

{"type":"gap","id":"gap-SH-NO-YAML-LIB","category":"UNDERSPECIFIED_NOW_IMPLEMENTED","priority":"P3","area":"ComposeAppProcess","spec_ref":"SH-DEPLOY-CONFIG","spec_file":"13-service-hub-v2.smd","spec_says":"No prescription on parser library.","impl_has":"stdlib only — no PyYAML/ruamel dependency. This is intentional (hub.py has no requirements.txt/dependencies).","impl_file":"hub.py:24-36","recommendation":"If hub.py gains a requirements.txt, switch to PyYAML (safe_load). The custom parser is a maintenance liability. For now, acceptable given zero-dependency goal.","status":"open","delta":"NEW"}

